  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/12/P1450407.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>(15 fotos) Beatriz Juan Garc&iacute;a simultanear&aacute; desde este viernes sus clases como monitora de zumba con la delegaci&oacute;n de la agencia de viajes Nautalia que ha abierto en la calle Salvador Barri de Onda, frente a la peluqueria de Daniel Alonso. Colaborar&aacute; con ella Silvia Catal&aacute;n Reverter, especialista como agente de viajes.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguracionautaliaonda/p1450395.jpg\" alt=\"p1450395\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguracionautaliaonda/p1450396.jpg\" alt=\"p1450396\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguracionautaliaonda/p1450398.jpg\" alt=\"p1450398\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguracionautaliaonda/p1450399.jpg\" alt=\"p1450399\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguracionautaliaonda/p1450400.jpg\" alt=\"p1450400\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguracionautaliaonda/p1450401.jpg\" alt=\"p1450401\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguracionautaliaonda/p1450403.jpg\" alt=\"p1450403\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguracionautaliaonda/p1450404.jpg\" alt=\"p1450404\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguracionautaliaonda/p1450407.jpg\" alt=\"p1450407\